# Agent get - an anonymous function that returns its argument unchanged

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:obsidian_livebook, path: "/home/scossar/projects/elixir/obsidian_livebook"}
])
```

## Agent.get

`Agent.get/2` passes the Agent's current state to the supplied function and returns the function's result:

```elixir
{:ok, _} = Agent.start_link(fn -> 0 end, name: :foo)
```

```elixir
Agent.get(:foo, fn state -> state end)
```

The anonymous function could also be written with the capture operator:

```elixir
Agent.get(:foo, & &1)
```

